{"headword":"עַמּוֹנִי","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>adj. gent. Ammonite</strong>;—abs. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַמּוֹנִי</span> as subst. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.4\">Dt 23:4</a> <em>an Ammonite</em> (generic), so <span dir=\"rtl\">עַמֹּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.1\">Ne 13:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמּוֹנִי</span> of individual <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.1\">1 S 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:37\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.37\">2 S 23:37</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.39\">1 Ch 11:39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.19\">Ne 2:19</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמֹּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.10\">2:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.35\">3:35</a>; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמֹּנִית</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.21\">1 K 14:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 12:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.12.13\">2 Ch 12:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.31\">1 K 14:31</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמּוֹנִית</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.26\">2 Ch 24:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמֹּנִי</span> as subst. coll. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:1\" href=\"/Ezra.9.1\">Ezr 9:1</a>; mpl. as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַמֹּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.5\">1 K 11:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.20\">Dt 2:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.1\">Ne 4:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמּוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.8\">2 Ch 26:8</a> (on <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.1\">20:1</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מְעוּנִים\" href=\"/BDB,_מְעוּנִים\", dir=\"rtl\">מְעוּנִים</a>); fpl. as adj. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַמֳּנִיֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.1\">1 K 11:1</a>, so <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.23\">Ne 13:23</a> Qr, Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">עמוניות</span>."}]},"rid":"BDB07387","strong_numbers":["5984","5985"],"next_hw":"עַמִּיאֵל²","prev_hw":"עַמּוֹן","all_cited":true,"alt_headwords":[{"word":"עַמֹּנִי"}],"quotes":[],"GK":["6649"],"TWOT":["1642a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}